# ROM-derived content NEVER commits (docs/VOXEL.md §1): everything the
# importer and cooker produce lives here.
#
# Both spellings on purpose: a trailing slash matches a DIRECTORY only, so a
# `dist` SYMLINK — which is how a second worktree borrows one cooked pak
# instead of re-cooking 32 MB — slips past `dist/` and lands in a commit.
/dist
/node_modules
dist/
target/
node_modules/
*.log

# Build output: the console binary is produced by `bun tools/voxel.ts 3ds`
# into target/, and a stale 34 MB copy of it once rode along in a commit.
*.3dsx
*.elf
# the cooker app's downloads and result
cooker/_work/
cooker/output/

# This machine's scratch: one-off patch scripts, the deploy/check scripts
# with local paths in them, and what they leave behind.
/apply_*.py
/patch_*.py
/cc_*
/.pv_build_id
/gamedata.json
__pycache__/

# working notes kept off the public tree (full of the games' names)
docs/YELLOW_VERSION_PLAN.md
docs/BLUE_VERSION_PLAN.md
docs/gold-plan.md
docs/gold-engine.md
docs/MAP_LOAD_PERF.md
